---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
const toc = [
  { id: "overview", label: "Overview" },
  { id: "collect", label: "What we collect" },
  { id: "use", label: "How we use it" },
  { id: "share", label: "When we share it" },
  { id: "cookies", label: "Cookies" },
  { id: "security", label: "Security" },
  { id: "choices", label: "Your choices" },
  { id: "children", label: "Children" },
  { id: "changes", label: "Changes" },
  { id: "contact", label: "Contact us" },
];
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy Policy" intro="How Aster OB/GYN handles information you share on this website." toc={toc}>
  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>Aster OB/GYN ("Aster," "we," "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect when you visit <strong>asterobgyn.com</strong>, how we use it, and the choices you have. It covers this website only. How we handle your health records is described in our <a href="/notice-of-privacy-practices/">Notice of Privacy Practices</a>.</p>
  <p class="note">Please do not send private medical details through the website contact form. For anything urgent or medical, call us at {site.phone}.</p>

  <h2 id="collect">What we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> If you fill in a form or contact us, we receive your name, email, phone number, subject and message. If you book through our scheduling system, patient portal or online intake form, those services collect information under their own privacy terms.</p>
  <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, our servers and tools may record your IP address, browser type, device, the pages you view, the time of your visit and the page that sent you to us. Optional tools of this kind are used only if you allow them in our cookie settings.</p>

  <h2 id="use">How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your messages and help you book or prepare for a visit.</li>
    <li>To run, protect and improve this website.</li>
    <li>To understand, in combined form, which pages are useful.</li>
    <li>To meet legal duties.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell, rent or lease your personal information.</p>

  <h2 id="share">When we share it</h2>
  <p>We share information only with trusted companies that help us run the website and our services (for example, web hosting, form delivery, scheduling, the patient portal and analytics). They may use it only to serve us and must keep it confidential. We may also share information when the law requires it, or to protect the safety and rights of patients, our staff and the public.</p>

  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use a small number of cookies and similar technologies. Necessary ones keep the site working. Optional ones are used only if you say yes. You can change your choice at any time with the <strong>Cookie Settings</strong> button in the page footer. Read more in our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="security">Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational steps to protect information, including encrypted connections (HTTPS) and limited access. No website or internet service is perfectly secure, so we cannot promise absolute security.</p>

  <h2 id="choices">Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Choose which cookies to allow in Cookie Settings.</li>
    <li>Turn on Global Privacy Control in your browser. We treat it as a request to keep optional cookies off.</li>
    <li>Ask us what personal information from this website we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by calling or writing to us. Some records we must keep by law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="children">Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children through the website.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of the page shows when it last changed. If we make a big change, we will make it clear on this website.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact us</h2>
  <p>Aster OB/GYN<br />{site.address[0]}, {site.address[1]}<br />Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
